<title>UK: Amey wins 24 mln stg track renewal deals.</title>
<headline>Amey wins 24 mln stg track renewal deals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British capital projects developer Amey Plc said on Wednesday that its unit Amey Railways had won three track renewal contracts worth 24 million stg.</p>
<p>Amey said the contracts were awarded by rail infrastructure operator Railtrack Plc's Western Region.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
